.venv/
data/raw/
data/processed/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytensor/
catboost_info/
.pytest_cache/

# Generated views of a prediction. The .parquet beside it is the record that
# matters and IS tracked -- a timestamped, tamper-evident note of what the model
# said before the games were played, which is the whole point of forward testing.
# index.html (the ledger) is tracked too, since 2026-09-27: untracked, a `git pull`
# brought new records but left the page showing the old ones. It is a pure
# function of the records and results, verified against them on every build, and
# CI fails if the committed page and records ever disagree.
data/predictions/*.html
!data/predictions/index.html
